# Everything this toolkit writes under reports/ is a run artifact, including
# scans of live targets. The curated reports the docs link to are listed back
# in by name: a new one has to be added here, which fails at `git add` rather
# than committing someone's scan by accident.
reports/*
!reports/SELF-AUDIT.md
!reports/demo_report.html
!reports/demo_report.json
!reports/live_demo_abfp.json
!reports/self-supply.json
